                <p>Source: Department of State, Central Files, 611.90D/6-1562. Secret. Drafted by
                    Gatch and McGhee and cleared by Grant, Cameron, McGhee, and McConaughy.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d138-f2" n="1" xml:id="d138-f2-content">
                <p>Breisky signed for Brubeck above Brubeck’s typed signature.</p>
